+| Display | 36/44 | 700 |
+| H1 | 28/36 | 700 |
+| H2 | 24/32 | 700 |
+| H3 | 20/28 | 600 |
+| Body | 16/24 | 400 |
+| Body Small | 14/20 | 400 |
